{"id":"st-ives-cornwall","name":"圣艾夫斯","en":"St Ives","country":"United Kingdom","lat":50.21,"lng":-5.48,"dek":"海雾、渔港与画室之间的小城","history":"圣艾夫斯的起源与一位爱尔兰圣徒有关。传说五世纪时，圣伊亚乘船抵达这片海岸，后来教堂便以她的名字命名，小镇也由此得名。中世纪起，捕鱼成为镇上的生计，港口在十五世纪已有文献提及，此后数个世纪，这里一直是康沃尔北岸重要的渔港之一。\n\n1487年，小镇获得市场特许状，每周集市与年度墟市随之而来。宗教改革时期，1549年的祈祷书叛乱波及此地，一位镇官被处决，成为这段历史里沉重的一笔。此后渔业继续支撑小镇，沙丁鱼捕捞与腌制曾是港口的主业，渔获远销地中海。\n\n十九世纪后期，铁路支线沿悬崖与海湾修到镇上，维多利亚时代的度假客随之而来，小镇的重心从渔获转向游客。二十世纪，画家们陆续在此定居，陶艺工作室也在山坡上开张。渔港仍在，只是更多停靠游船与钓鱼船，旧日的生活方式被画廊与旅馆重新包裹。","culture":"圣艾夫斯的名字与现代英国艺术紧密相连。二十世纪上半叶，一批艺术家被这里的光线与海色吸引，在此工作、教学、展出，使小镇逐渐成为英国现代主义的一个据点。陶艺家伯纳德·利奇在山坡上建立工作室，把东方陶艺传统带入康沃尔。\n\n今天，泰特美术馆的分馆坐落在海边，圆形建筑与旧煤气厂的轮廓相呼应，馆藏侧重康沃尔本地艺术家。芭芭拉·赫普沃斯的故居与雕塑园保留了她工作与生活的空间，花园里的石雕与海风相伴。镇上还散落着不少小型画廊与工作室，艺术不只是展品，也是小城日常的一部分。","pull":"海风把渔港和画室吹在同一片坡地上","sights":[{"name":"泰特圣艾夫斯","orig":"Tate St Ives","intro":"泰特美术馆在海边的分馆，圆形建筑呼应旧煤气厂的轮廓。馆藏以康沃尔本地艺术家为主，阿尔弗雷德·沃利斯、特里·弗罗斯特与芭芭拉·赫普沃斯的作品常在此展出，展厅窗外就是海滩。","img":{"u":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/11/Tate_St_Ives_-_geograph.org.uk_-_1208300.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B3%B0%E7%89%B9%E5%9C%A3%E8%89%BE%E5%A4%AB%E6%96%AF"},{"name":"芭芭拉·赫普沃斯博物馆与雕塑园","orig":"Barbara Hepworth Museum and Sculpture Garden","intro":"雕塑家赫普沃斯生前工作与生活的居所，室内保留工作室原貌，花园里散布着她用青铜、石材与木材创作的作品。空间不大，却能看出雕塑与植物、光线之间的关系。","img":{"u":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/de/Barbara_Hepworth_Sculpture_Garden%2C_St_Ives_-_geograph.org.uk_-_11244.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","w":960,"h":720},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Barbara_Hepworth_Museum"},{"name":"圣艾夫斯博物馆","orig":"The St. Ives Museum","intro":"介绍小镇地方历史的博物馆，两层建筑先后做过腌鱼厂、礼拜堂、洗衣房和电影院。展品涉及渔业、救生艇与旧日生活，适合了解港口在旅游时代之前的模样。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/14/St_Ives_Museum_-_geograph.org.uk_-_3050128.jpg/960px-St_Ives_Museum_-_geograph.org.uk_-_3050128.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":638},"src":null},{"name":"利奇陶艺","orig":"Leach Pottery","intro":"陶艺家伯纳德·利奇建立的工作室，如今包含博物馆与商店。这里可以看到康沃尔陶艺传统的延续，窑炉与工作台仍在运转，器皿的风格朴素，强调日常使用。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6d/The_Leach_Pottery%2C_St._Ives%2C_Cornwall_-_Museum_Entrance.jpg/960px-The_Leach_Pottery%2C_St._Ives%2C_Cornwall_-_Museum_Entrance.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":1434},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Leach_Pottery"},{"name":"阿尼玛-蒙迪","orig":"Anima-Mundi","intro":"镇上的当代艺术画廊，位于Street-an-Pol，轮换展出当代纯艺术与陶瓷作品。空间不大，展览更迭频繁，适合在看海之余顺路看看当下陶艺与绘画的走向。","img":null,"src":null}],"foods":[{"name":"康沃尔馅饼","orig":"Cornish pasty","intro":"酥皮包裹牛肉、土豆、芜菁与洋葱，边缘捏出厚褶。传统上是渔工与矿工的便携午餐，如今在镇上面包店与馅饼店都能买到，趁热吃最实在。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/39/Cornish_Pasty_%28cropped%29.jpeg/960px-Cornish_Pasty_%28cropped%29.jpeg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":653},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%BA%B7%E7%93%A6%E7%88%BE%E9%A4%A1%E9%A4%85"},{"name":"康沃尔奶油茶","orig":"Cornish cream tea","intro":"司康饼配凝脂奶油与果酱，康沃尔的吃法是先涂果酱再抹奶油。镇上的茶馆与咖啡馆多在下午供应，配一壶红茶，坐在窗边看海。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/03/Devonshire_tea.jpg/960px-Devonshire_tea.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":593},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cream_tea"},{"name":"沙丁鱼","orig":"Pilchard","intro":"沙丁鱼曾是圣艾夫斯渔港的主业，腌制后远销地中海。如今鲜鱼仍出现在当地餐馆的菜单上，简单煎烤，配面包与海盐，是港口历史留在餐桌上的味道。","img":{"u":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6a/Sardina_pilchardus_2011.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","w":960,"h":607},"src":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B2%99%E4%B8%81%E9%AD%9A"},{"name":"康沃尔冰淇淋","orig":"Cornish ice cream","intro":"以康沃尔牛奶制成的冰淇淋，质地厚实，香草与凝脂奶油口味常见。海边的小店多有出售，沿着港口或海滩边走边吃，是镇上夏天的日常。","img":{"u":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8e/Cornish_ice_cream.jpg/960px-Cornish_ice_cream.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","w":960,"h":638},"src":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cornish_ice_cream"}],"hero":[{"u":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/54/Stives1.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","w":1280,"h":960}],"outline":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[-5.5274754,50.2143848],[-5.5216225,50.199363],[-5.5222682,50.1983484],[-5.5180641,50.1962034],[-5.5184416,50.1955064],[-5.5164147,50.1936903],[-5.515134,50.1940547],[-5.5157307,50.1922401],[-5.5148393,50.1915329],[-5.5100414,50.1901056],[-5.5088695,50.1882473],[-5.493731,50.1894643],[-5.4874193,50.1854241],[-5.480687,50.1837145],[-5.4732474,50.1795885],[-5.4683463,50.1787509],[-5.4629242,50.17321],[-5.4472793,50.1759601],[-5.445543,50.1776626],[-5.4433359,50.1765055],[-5.4369882,50.176073],[-5.4352436,50.1798621],[-5.4358017,50.184629],[-5.4300561,50.1866412],[-5.4358881,50.1933851],[-5.4340503,50.2009801],[-5.4369487,50.200344],[-5.4373647,50.2010241],[-5.4431951,50.198218],[-5.4520975,50.1979445],[-5.4624867,50.1990051],[-5.468759,50.2008069],[-5.4694243,50.2014375],[-5.4690846,50.2064712],[-5.4737997,50.2084506],[-5.4777975,50.2119538],[-5.4776102,50.2133484],[-5.4750594,50.2147086],[-5.4757103,50.2157363],[-5.4744344,50.2167239],[-5.475783,50.2175412],[-5.4750646,50.2182387],[-5.4756677,50.2189089],[-5.479402,50.2193367],[-5.4806309,50.2177245],[-5.4872691,50.2161841],[-5.4879042,50.2169682],[-5.4926742,50.2172188],[-5.4958143,50.2204683],[-5.4992296,50.2198687],[-5.5005833,50.2190164],[-5.5006577,50.2178302],[-5.5021549,50.2188799],[-5.5041512,50.2174783],[-5.5076681,50.2178093],[-5.5087685,50.2189132],[-5.5106923,50.2163755],[-5.5142033,50.21594],[-5.5168312,50.2171271],[-5.517976,50.2164132],[-5.5186688,50.2177668],[-5.5208165,50.2171907],[-5.5203243,50.2150977],[-5.5274754,50.2143848]]]},"credit":{"model":"deepseek-flash","wiki":{"zh":"圣艾夫斯 (康沃尔郡)","en":"St Ives, Cornwall","voyage":"St Ives"}}}